OS 4.0
\ Malformed frames at every layer, random ones, and hostile telnet clients (tools/netpeer.py hostile)  ok
echo-service  1 max-syn-retries !  ok
variable served  ok
: (serve) ( conn -- ) begin pad 256 2 pick get-line dup 0< 0= while pad swap 2 pick send-line repeat 2drop ;  ok
: serve ( conn -- ) 10000 io-timeout !  dup ['] (serve) catch if drop then  close-connection  1 served +! ;  ok
: line-server ( -- ) 5000 listen begin 5000 accept-connection ['] serve spawn drop again ;  ok
task server  ' line-server server start  ok
variable peer-done  ok
: done ( data len -- ) 2drop true peer-done ! ;  ok
' done 5001 udp-bind  ok
: spin ( data len -- ) 2drop begin again ;  ok
' spin 5002 udp-bind  ok
: settled? ( -- flag ) peer-done @  conns @ 0= and  served @ 1 = and  sessions-served @ 3 = and ;  ok
: settle ( -- ) 80000 deadline begin 200 ms settled? over expired? or until drop ;  ok
settle peer-done @ . served @ . sessions-served @ .  conns @ count-list . -1 1 3 0  ok
1000 ms  ok
